Technical Range
Over his career, Shalabi has mastered and innovated within multiple techniques:
| Period | Technique | Key Characteristics |
|--------|-----------|---------------------|
| 1987–1998 | Oil painting (spontaneous) | Simplification, expressive lines, rural themes |
| 1998–2003 | Collage / Mixed media | Wire, fabric, sand, wood, newspaper |
| 2003–2009 | Colored pastes (self-developed) | Thick texture, palette knife, sand and glue base |
| 2009–2016 | Photography / Performance | Digital manipulation, the body as material |
| 2016–2020 | Return to painting | Coastal scenes, warm colors, simplified figures |
| 2023–present | Installation / Video / Conceptual | Multi-sensory, immersive, perceptual disruption |
